Z||000000||COUNTIBLIS||08-07-2001||10:47 AM||||Does anyone know where abouts kentucky, Indiana, tenn, or southern ohio, that can put in a 3800 supercharged engine in right? ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||08-07-2001||11:51 AM||||Bob Stieger at Twin Lakes Fiero does an excellent job with 3800's. He's about a 5 hour drive from you (305 miles). Give him a call at 217-379-9140. I have seen (and drove one of them) That he has done and it was very good. <BR>I think someone here had a 3800 done by him (Old Lar ??) and they were very happy with it.||||reg||1
